 "topic": "Criminal Profile: GTA 6 tracks what kind of criminal you are, separately for Jason and Lucia; hurting people who didn't need hurting pushes it from Professional toward Psycho; self-defense and a wanted level alone don't count; it changes how Focus refills and how aggressive the police are; at the worst profiles you can no longer surrender",
 "title": {
